## B. Delta check toy model: same-patient pairs vs specimen mix-ups (n = 200000 pairs each)
Set points ~ lognormal(CV_G); results = set point x (1 + N(0, sqrt(CV_I^2 + CV_A^2))). Mix-up: 2nd result from another patient.
II = CV_I/CV_G; threshold = symmetric RCV at Z (percent change, |delta| > RCV flags).
